早饭"},{"key":"C","text":"吃晚饭"},{"key":"D","text":"上音乐课"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"lunch 是午饭。","verify":"\"吃午饭\""},{"id":"cne_p089_q4","topicId":"cne_p089","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"It is 7 o'clock. It is time for breakfast. 该吃哪一餐？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"午饭"},{"key":"B","text":"早饭"},{"key":"C","text":"晚饭"},{"key":"D","text":"下午茶"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"breakfast 是早饭。","verify":"\"早饭\""},{"id":"cne_p090_q1","topicId":"cne_p090","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"现在 9 点，该上音乐课了，应说哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It is 9 o'clock. It is time for lunch."},{"key":"B","text":"It is 6 o'clock. It is time for breakfast."},{"key":"C","text":"It is 12 o'clock. It is time for dinner."},{"key":"D","text":"It is 9 o'clock. It is time for music."}],"answer":"D","explanation":"音乐是 music，时刻要和 9 点一致。","verify":"\"It is 9 o'clock. It is time for music.\""},{"id":"cne_p090_q2","topicId":"cne_p090","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"What time is it? 若是 12 点，应回答哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It is 12 o'clock."},{"key":"B","text":"It is 10 o'clock."},{"key":"C","text":"It is 2 o'clock."},{"key":"D","text":"It is 8 o'clock."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"12 点说 It is 12 o'clock。","verify":"\"It is 12 o'clock.\""},{"id":"cne_p090_q3","topicId":"cne_p090","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"It is time for English. 该上什么课？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"音乐"},{"key":"B","text":"英语"},{"key":"C","text":"数学"},{"key":"D","text":"体育"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"English 是英语。","verify":"\"英语\""},{"id":"cne_p090_q4","topicId":"cne_p090","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Hurry up! It is time for school. 这句是在催什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"该吃晚饭了"},{"key":"B","text":"该睡觉了"},{"key":"C","text":"该去上学了"},{"key":"D","text":"该回家了"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"time for school 是该上学了。","verify":"\"该去上学了\""},{"id":"cne_p091_q1","topicId":"cne_p091","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：It is 7 o'clock. It is time for breakfast. 7 点该做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"吃早饭"},{"key":"B","text":"吃午饭"},{"key":"C","text":"吃晚饭"},{"key":"D","text":"上音乐课"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"breakfast 是早饭。","verify":"\"吃早饭\""},{"id":"cne_p091_q2","topicId":"cne_p091","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：It is 12 o'clock. Have some lunch. 几点吃午饭？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"7 点"},{"key":"B","text":"12 点"},{"key":"C","text":"6 点"},{"key":"D","text":"9 点"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"12 o'clock。","verify":"\"12 点\""},{"id":"cne_p091_q3","topicId":"cne_p091","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"读一读：Music is at 9 o'clock. 音乐课是几点？","answer":"9","explanation":"at 9 o'clock 是 9 点。","verify":"9"},{"id":"cne_p091_q4","topicId":"cne_p091","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：It is 6 o'clock. It is time for dinner. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"6 点该吃早饭了。"},{"key":"B","text":"7 点该吃晚饭了。"},{"key":"C","text":"6 点该上音乐课了。"},{"key":"D","text":"6 点该吃晚饭了。"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"6 o'clock 和 dinner。","verify":"\"6 点该吃晚饭了。\""},{"id":"cne_p248_q1","topicId":"cne_p248","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想说「该起床了」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It's time to get up."},{"key":"B","text":"It's time to getting up."},{"key":"C","text":"It's time for get up."},{"key":"D","text":"It time to get up."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"It's time to + 动词原形。","verify":"\"It's time to get up.\""},{"id":"cne_p248_q2","topicId":"cne_p248","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"It's time for breakfast. 这句是在说？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"该睡觉了"},{"key":"B","text":"该上学了"},{"key":"C","text":"该放学了"},{"key":"D","text":"该吃早饭了"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"time for breakfast。","verify":"\"该吃早饭了\""},{"id":"cne_p248_q3","topicId":"cne_p248","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪一句正确？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"It's time for go to school."},{"key":"B","text":"It's time going to school."},{"key":"C","text":"It's time to go to school."},{"key":"D","text":"It's time to goes to school."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"time to + 原形。","verify":"\"It's time to go to school.\""},{"id":"cne_p248_q4","topicId":"cne_p248","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：It's 7:00. It's time to ____. 早上七点最合适填？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"sleep in class"},{"key":"B","text":"go to school"},{"key":"C","text":"go to bed"},{"key":"D","text":"watch TV all night"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"七点常是上学时间。","verify":"\"go to school\""},{"id":"cne_p249_q1","topicId":"cne_p249","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：7:00 get up. 7:30 breakfast. 七点半做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"吃早饭"},{"key":"B","text":"起床"},{"key":"C","text":"睡觉"},{"key":"D","text":"放学"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"7:30 breakfast。","verify":"\"吃早饭\""},{"id":"cne_p249_q2","topicId":"cne_p249","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：It's time to go to bed at 9:00. 九点该做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"起床"},{"key":"B","text":"吃早饭"},{"key":"C","text":"去上学"},{"key":"D","text":"睡觉"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"go to bed。","verify":"\"睡觉\""},{"id":"cne_p249_q3","topicId":"cne_p249","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Amy: 6:30 get up; 7:00 go to school. 艾米几点去上学？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"8 点"},{"key":"B","text":"9 点"},{"key":"C","text":"7 点"},{"key":"D","text":"6:30"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"7:00 go to school。","verify":"\"7 点\""},{"id":"cne_p249_q4","topicId":"cne_p249","difficulty":"challenge","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Tom gets up at 6:30. He has breakfast at 7:00. It's time to go at 7:20. 他先做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"先睡觉"},{"key":"B","text":"起床"},{"key":"C","text":"先出门"},{"key":"D","text":"先吃晚饭"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"先 get up，再 breakfast，再 go。","verify":"\"起床\""}]
